# Vue Conventions

## Component Structure
Vue SFCs use this section order:
1. `<template>`
2. `<script>`
3. `<style>` (if present)

## Organization
- `Pages/` contains only Inertia pages (Index, Show, Edit, Create). Pages compose components; they do not define reusable ones.
- `Components/` holds reusable components, organized by domain, following atomic design (`docs/ATOMIC_DESIGN.md`).

## Style
- Use `BaseButton` instead of raw `<button>` tags.
- Prefer composition over large monolithic files.
- Use proper TypeScript types and props definitions.
